<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-zizhitongjian" book-id="b-zizhitongjian-163" chapter-id="c-zizhitongjian-163-xiaolun-wei-zheng" source-id="s-zizhitongjian-163-xiaolun-wei-zheng-ws803203">
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-163-xiaolun-wei-zheng:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zizhitongjian-163-xiaolun-wei-zheng:p001:m0000" ref="81y_7i5_frc">邵陵王綸</persName>聞之，遣其子威正侯<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-163-xiaolun-wei-zheng:p001:m0013" ref="81y_7i5_frc_C">礩</persName>將兵擊之，龍虎敗，奔於<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-163-xiaolun-wei-zheng:p001:m0025" ref="g7w_9tv_iqb">僧辯</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-163-xiaolun-wei-zheng:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">麾下壯士爭請出戰，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-163-xiaolun-wei-zheng:p002:m0009" ref="81y_7i5_frc">綸</persName>不從，與<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-163-xiaolun-wei-zheng:p002:m0014" ref="81y_7i5_frc_C">礩</persName>自倉門登舟北出。</p>
</text>
